EPS=[
("The Midnight Pact","The initial awakening and the pact forged at 12:00 AM.","The clock strikes twelve and the sewing box stirs. CaSi wakes with a yellow pot full of keys she does not yet understand, and the household’s tools gather around her. Before the hour ends, they swear a pact: thirty nights to find the ten Star Keys.",["The first stroke of midnight wakes the yarn","The sewing box allies meet CaSi","The 30-night pact is sworn"],["casi","snip","pip","spool"],"The Pact Key"),
("The Sting of the Needle","Midnight combat training against skittering dust mites.","Pip insists that no hero walks into the dark untrained. Needles in hand, CaSi learns to fight among crimson threads while dust mites skitter out of the shadows, eyes glowing.",["Pip runs the first training drill","CaSi’s first needle stand","The dust mites close in"],["casi","pip","snip"],"The Needle Key"),
("The Rattle in the Rust","Purifying the corrupted antique key in the sewing box.","Something at the bottom of the box is rattling. An antique key, eaten by rust and shadow, tries to break free. CaSi must hold her nerve and cleanse it as gears and buttons fly.",["A corrupted key wakes in the box","Snip cuts a path through the rust","CaSi purifies it at the golden keyhole"],["casi","snip"],"The Rust Key"),
("The First Star Key","Venturing into the blue linen constellation hallway.","Beyond the box, the house opens into a hallway of blue linen and drifting stars. Guided by Spool’s light, CaSi walks a sky stitched from fabric toward the first Star Key.",["Spool lights the way","The linen hallway turns into a night sky","The first Star Key answers CaSi"],["casi","spool"],"The First Star Key"),
("The Attic of Forgotten Toys","Navigating the haunting zero-gravity toy chamber.","In the attic, gravity has forgotten everything. Cracked dolls drift past, puppets sway on tangled strings, and every shadow on the wall seems to watch CaSi float by.",["Gravity fails in the attic","The puppets tangle the team","Pip holds the line while CaSi finds a way out"],["casi","pip","snip"],"The Toy Key"),
("The Needle’s Edge","Balancing over the mirror abyss of shadow reflections.","A single silver thread stretches across a bottomless dark. Below, shattered mirrors show the monsters CaSi could become. One careful step at a time, she crosses.",["The thread over the abyss","Reflections of the Shadow King","Spool’s thread keeps CaSi steady"],["casi","snip","spool"],"The Mirror Key"),
("The Shadow King’s Shadow","Confronting the colossal obsidian portal.","The Shadow King does not appear yet, only his shadow, huge and horned inside a ring of black stone. Alone on a floating shard, CaSi lets her golden light answer the dark.",["The obsidian portal opens","The Shadow King’s silhouette rises","CaSi’s light holds the line"],["casi","snip","pip","spool"],"The Light Key"),
("Spool’s Unraveling","A heroic sacrifice of fiber stardust.","When the shadows close in, Spool gives everything she has. Her rainbow thread unspools into a shield of fiber stardust that protects CaSi, and the squad learns what loyalty costs.",["Spool spins her last thread","A dome of stardust protects CaSi","The squad mourns and carries on"],["casi","spool","pip"],"The Stardust Key"),
("The Locksmith’s Secret","Unlocking the multidimensional gear mechanism.","At the heart of the house sits a lock older than the house itself: a mechanism of gears across many dimensions. CaSi slides a Star Key into it and the whole machine turns.",["The gear mechanism awakens","A Star Key turns the lock","The locksmith’s secret is revealed"],["casi","snip","pip"],"The Gear Key"),
("The 30th Night","The climactic 30-notch clock battle for the front door lock.","The final night. A clock with thirty notches ticks toward dawn while the Shadow King makes his move on the front door lock. Every key, every friend and every midnight of training comes down to this.",["Thirty notches, one last night","The squad stands together at the door","The front door lock opens"],["casi","snip","pip","spool"],"The Front Door Key")]
CH=[
("casi","CaSi","The Secret Key Holder","The Fiber Guardian","Handcrafted from green yarn and armed with a glowing pink blossom, CaSi wields sewing needles and Star Keys to defend the household.","CaSi is the smallest hero in the house and the only one who can carry the Star Keys. Crocheted from green yarn, with a pink blossom on her curl and a yellow yarn pot that holds every key she finds, she is gentle, stubborn and braver than anything her size should be.","var(--green-lit)",[("Star Key wielding","Opens sealed doors and purifies corrupted keys."),("Needle dance","Fights with sewing needles during midnight training."),("Yarn roots","Green tendrils below her pot anchor her against the Shadow King’s pull.")],"assets/casi-cutout.png"),
("snip","Snip","The Blade of Precision","Silver Tailor Scissors","Swift, sharp, and fiercely loyal, Snip cuts through shadow tendrils with razor precision.","Snip is a pair of silver tailor scissors with a fast temper and a faster edge. Fiercely loyal, he is always first through a dark corridor and last to leave a friend behind.","#cfd8e6",[("Tendril cutter","Slices shadow tendrils in a single pass."),("Silver flash","Catches moonlight to blind the creatures of the dark."),("Loyal stance","Stands guard at CaSi’s side whatever the odds.")],"assets/chars/snip.jpg"),
("pip","Pip","The Cushion of Fortitude","Crimson Tomato Pincushion","The cheerful tactical tank who carries an arsenal of defensive pins and needle rapiers.","Pip is a crimson tomato pincushion who smiles through everything. Behind the cheerful face is the squad’s tactician and its toughest wall, wearing a ring of pins and needle rapiers.","var(--red)",[("Pin barrage","Launches a storm of defensive pins."),("Cushion guard","Absorbs hits meant for the rest of the squad."),("Needle rapiers","Hands out training needles and teaches the stance.")],"assets/chars/pip.jpg"),
("spool","Spool","The Thread of Fate","Rainbow Fiber Weaver","Boundless energy woven into vibrant thread, capable of binding shadowy beasts and repairing broken bonds.","Spool is a spool of rainbow thread humming with boundless energy. She binds beasts, mends what is broken and weaves the light that guides the squad through the dark.","var(--gold)",[("Thread binding","Ties shadow beasts in bright knots."),("Mending weave","Repairs broken objects and broken bonds."),("Fate line","Draws a path of light through the unknown.")],"assets/chars/spool.jpg")]
